{
  "_instructions": [
    "This is the ONE file to edit for Circuit Breaker content — brand logos, the MCB/MCCB/Magnetic Contactor nav icons, and every breaker's photo + specs all live here now. No other file needs to change when you update a value below.",
    "Leave 'logo', 'navIcon', or a product's 'image' as an empty string \"\" until you have a real file uploaded under public/. Once it's uploaded, paste its site path here (e.g. \"/images/products/circuit-breaker/mcb/schneider-acti9-6a.jpg\") — the site picks it up automatically on next build/refresh.",
    "While a nav icon is empty, the mega menu and mobile nav fall back to showing the matching pole icon (SP/DP/TP) as a stand-in — that's expected until you fill it in.",
    "'category' must be exactly one of: mcb, mccb, magnetic-contactor.",
    "'pole' is only used for MCB products and must be exactly one of: SP, DP, TP. Omit the field entirely for MCCB and Magnetic Contactor products — real MCCB breakers are always 3-pole, so MCCB has no pole selector on the site at all (same as Magnetic Contactor).",
    "To add a brand: add an object to \"brands\" with a new unique 'slug' (lowercase, hyphenated) and 'name'.",
    "To add a breaker: add an object to that brand's \"products\" array with a new unique 'id'.",
    "Ratings here (rated current, breaking capacity, voltage, curve type) are illustrative placeholders per CLAUDE.md until replaced with real catalog specs — replace them the same way, by editing the value in place.",
    "'madeIn' (country of manufacture) is optional — add it to a product if you know it, or leave it out; it only shows on the card when present.",
    "'model' (the specific SKU/model number, e.g. \"SH201-C40\") is optional and distinct from 'series' (the product line, e.g. \"S200\") and 'name' (its marketing name) — add it to a product if you know it; it only shows on the card when present.",
    "Fields not already listed here (e.g. adding a brand-new spec beyond madeIn) won't show up on the site just by adding them to a product — they still need a matching field wired into src/lib/circuit-breakers.ts and the card component. Ask for that to be added once, then every product can use it.",
    "'categories.<slug>.cardImage' is the photo shown on the /products/circuit-breaker landing page's 'Browse by Type' cards (MCB / MCCB / Magnetic Contactor) — already pointing at the generated placeholder files; replace the path the same way once you have a real photo.",
    "'categories.<slug>.navIcon' is a separate, smaller icon used only in the mega menu / mobile nav — leave it empty until you have a dedicated icon graphic; until then the nav falls back to showing the matching SP/DP/TP pole icon."
  ],
